// RT15 (2026-10-04) — probe for the capture lane. Queue: docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-10-04-rt15-presentation.md
// Chart: NYSE:RDDT 1D from the listing.
// ⚠️ Not compiled on TradingView yet: if a row does not compile, the error names the line — split it out.
//
// Q-RT15c — a paint `offset` that is an INPUT-dependent expression
// (visualizing-displacement-tfo: `barcolor(…, offset = require_fvg ? -1 : na)`).
// Capture once as written (flag true -> offset -1), once with the input set false
// (offset = na): is `offset = na` drawn as offset 0, or not drawn?
//@version=5
indicator("vw-rt15-paint-offset", overlay = true)
flag = input.bool(true, "flag")
up = close > open and close > close[1]
barcolor(up ? color.yellow : na, offset = flag ? -1 : na, title = "P01 barcolor input offset")
plot(up ? 1 : 0, "P02 up", display = display.data_window)
